# The bank's own workbooks live here, supplied per deployment.
#
# CIMB BizConverter is CIMB's licensed tool and a filled copy carries the
# customer's company details, so it cannot ship with Bills Hub or go in a
# public repository. Save yours from Excel as .xlsm (which keeps the macros
# and, unlike .xls, is a format Bills Hub can fill) and drop it in here:
#
#   CIMB BizConverter.xlsm
#
# Everything Bills Hub does not write is copied through byte for byte.
